OL,3,ADanny Dyer in floating poo water
OL,4,Aprotest on Thames
OL,5,
OL,6,FActor Danny Dyer has delivered a
OL,7,Fpetition to Downing Street calling for
OL,8,Fwater companies to be nationalised
OL,9,Fafter floating a giant poo sculpture
OL,10,Fdown the River Thames on a boat.
OL,12,FDyer and Sittingbourne and Sheppey MP
OL,13,FKevin McKenna sailed along the Thames
OL,14,Fwith the sculpture as part of a protest
OL,15,Fcalling for the water industry to be
OL,16,Fbrought into public ownership.
OL,18,FThe actor, who runs a caravan park on
OL,19,Fthe Isle of Sheppey with daughter Dani
OL,20,FDyer, delivered the petition having
OL,21,Fpreviously joined a local sewage
OL,22,Fprotest in Leysdown in September.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
